# Send only the application and its locked build inputs to Docker.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!ui/
!ui/**

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/coverage/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
